"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bedroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/197973d5-c2b9-4aa1-8ed2-487cc7f23752.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bedroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1695705/c8250449-feb8-4732-953f-9fde7684ee00.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"ENGLISH VERSION BELOW!\nMit diesem Appartment habe ich einen perfekten Ort für einen gesunden Lebensstil und Selfcare geschaffen. Die vollausgestattete Küche mit verschiedenen Kleingeräten, überwiegend plastikfreien Utensilien und einem Keimglas ermöglichen gesunde Ernährung. Eine Yogamatte und ein großer TV schaffen beste Voraussetzungen für eine gesunde Morgenroutine - ob mit Yoga, Qigong oder Functional Training.\n\nAuf dem sonnigen Balkon lässt sich bei einem guten Buch Vitamin D tanken, und der Kurpark direkt vor der Haustür lädt zum Spazieren und Joggen ein. Unzählige Wanderrouten in unmittelbarer Umgebung laden zur Bewegung in der Natur ein. In nur 3 Gehminuten bietet die Therme eine weitläufige Saunalandschaft zum Entgiften, Sole-Räume sowie Heilwasser zur inneren und äußeren Remineralisierung. \n\nDas weiche Bett ist 1,40m breit, ein großer Schrank bietet ausreichend Platz für Hab und Gut. Der leichte Schreibtisch lässt sich so verschieben, dass an verschiedenen Orten der Wohnung gearbeitet werden kann. Im Keller gibt es Waschmaschine und Trockner, zu nutzen mit 1€-Münzen. Im Zimmer gibt es Bügelausstattung und Trockengestell. Die Wohnung ist vollausgestattet, sodass Sie nur noch mit Ihrem Koffer anreisen müssen!\n\n*\n\nWith this appartment, I’ve created the perfect place for a healthy lifestyle and self‐care. The fully equipped kitchen—with various small appliances, mostly plastic‐free utensils, and a sprouting jar—makes it easy to maintain healthy eating habits even while away from home. A yoga mat and a large TV provide ideal conditions for a nourishing morning routine, whether you prefer yoga, qigong, or functional training.\n\nOn the sunny balcony, you can soak up vitamin D with a good book, and the spa gardens right outside the door invite you to stroll or go for a jog. Countless hiking trails in the immediate surroundings offer wonderful opportunities to move your body in nature. Just a 3‐minute walk away, the thermal spa features an extensive sauna area for detoxing, salt rooms, and healing mineral water for internal and external remineralization.\n\nThe soft bed is 1.40 m wide, and a large wardrobe offers plenty of space for your belongings. The lightweight desk can be moved around so you can work from different spots in the apartment. In the basement, you’ll find a washing machine and dryer that operate with €1 coins. The room also includes ironing equipment and a drying rack. The apartment is fully equipped—so all you need to bring is your suitcase!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"0"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"37"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":85000,"deposit":100000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"850.00","deposit":"1000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":0,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-08-15"}],"updated":"2026-08-15T06:39:30Z","__utId__":"ut1695705"}]